 ### [Seed Line Integral Convolution](8864-seed-line-integral-convolution.md)
-Computes LIC only along field lines from specific seed points, reducing computational cost compared to Fast LIC by exploiting sparsity, though it is more susceptible to aliasing. Choose when memory or compute is constrained and sparse sampling is acceptable.
