 ## Operating characteristics
-*   **Time Complexity:** Standard LIC is computationally expensive, as it requires integrating streamlines for every pixel in the field [S1, unofficial]. Optimized versions (e.g., Fast LIC) reduce this by reusing calculations for adjacent pixels along the same streamline [S1, unofficial].
